{"seq":3,"slug":"subtyping-coercion","title":"子类型与隐式转换","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/type-checking-semantic-analysis/type-checking/subtyping-coercion","wordCount":1550,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"子类型与隐式转换\">子类型与隐式转换</h1><p>把一个 <code>Cat</code> 传给参数类型是 <code>Animal</code> 的函数，编译器放行；把一个 <code>int</code> 赋给 <code>double</code> 变量，编译器悄悄插入一次转换。这两件日常操作背后是两个看似相近实则不同的机制——子类型（subtyping）与隐式转换（coercion）。前者说「这个类型可以无损地当作那个类型用」，后者说「这个值需要被改造成那个类型」。理清二者的边界、以及子类型在函数与泛型上引出的协变逆变规则，是类型检查从「相等判定」走向「关系判定」的关键一跃。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><a href=\"type-inference\">类型推断</a> 里合一处理的是「类型相等」，而子类型处理的是「类型可替换」。子类型关系记作 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mo>:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S &lt;: T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>，读作「<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 的子类型」，遵循里氏替换原则：任何期望 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 的地方都能安全地用一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 的值代替。它带来一条新的类型规则——包含规则（subsumption）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Γ</mi><mo>⊢</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>S</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>S</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mo>:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Γ</mi><mo>⊢</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\Gamma \\vdash e : S \\quad S &lt;: T}{\\Gamma \\vdash e : T}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊢</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊢</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>子类型本身是一个偏序：自反（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mo>:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T &lt;: T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>）且传递（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mo>:</mo><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S &lt;: U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mo>:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U &lt;: T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mo>:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S &lt;: T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>）。隐式转换则不同：它不是「同一个值换个看法」，而是「生成一个新值」——<code>int</code> 转 <code>double</code> 会真的改变位表示。下表把两者掰开。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>子类型 (subtyping)</th>\n<th>隐式转换 (coercion)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>本质</td>\n<td>同一个值可被视作另一类型</td>\n<td>生成一个表示不同的新值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运行时开销</td>\n<td>通常为零</td>\n<td>可能有（如整型转浮点）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型例子</td>\n<td><code>Cat &lt;: Animal</code>、<code>Int &lt;: Number</code></td>\n<td><code>int → double</code>、<code>char → int</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>风险</td>\n<td>数组/可变容器的型变不当导致不安全</td>\n<td>精度丢失、意外重载选择</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实现位置</td>\n<td>类型检查时验证关系</td>\n<td>类型检查时插入转换节点</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"协变-逆变与不变\">协变、逆变与不变</h2><p>子类型一旦遇到复合类型（函数、泛型容器），就要回答「分量的子类型关系如何传导到整体」。这就是型变（variance）。最反直觉也最重要的是函数类型的规则：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mo>:</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mo>:</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>→</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mtext> </mtext><mo>&lt;</mo><mo>:</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>→</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{T_1 &lt;: S_1 \\quad S_2 &lt;: T_2}{S_1 \\to S_2\\ &lt;:\\ T_1 \\to T_2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;:</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>注意参数位置反了过来：函数在<strong>返回类型上协变</strong>（covariant，子类型方向一致），在<strong>参数类型上逆变</strong>（contravariant，子类型方向相反）。直觉是：一个能接受更宽参数、返回更窄结果的函数，可以安全替代一个接受更窄参数、返回更宽结果的函数。可变容器（如可写数组）则必须<strong>不变</strong>（invariant）——<code>Array&lt;Cat&gt;</code> 既不是也不能当 <code>Array&lt;Animal&gt;</code>，否则就能往猫数组里塞条狗。Java 数组协变是著名的不安全设计，代价是运行时 <code>ArrayStoreException</code>。型变规则如何作用在泛型参数上，会在 <a href=\"../advanced-typing/generics-polymorphism\">泛型与多态检查</a> 里继续展开。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[复合类型的型变] --&gt; B[协变 covariant&lt;br/&gt;方向一致]&#10;  A --&gt; C[逆变 contravariant&lt;br/&gt;方向相反]&#10;  A --&gt; D[不变 invariant&lt;br/&gt;必须相等]&#10;  B --&gt; B1[函数返回类型&lt;br/&gt;不可变只读容器]&#10;  C --&gt; C1[函数参数类型&lt;br/&gt;消费者位置]&#10;  D --&gt; D1[可变容器&lt;br/&gt;读写双向]\">flowchart TD\n  A[复合类型的型变] --&gt; B[协变 covariant&lt;br/&gt;方向一致]\n  A --&gt; C[逆变 contravariant&lt;br/&gt;方向相反]\n  A --&gt; D[不变 invariant&lt;br/&gt;必须相等]\n  B --&gt; B1[函数返回类型&lt;br/&gt;不可变只读容器]\n  C --&gt; C1[函数参数类型&lt;br/&gt;消费者位置]\n  D --&gt; D1[可变容器&lt;br/&gt;读写双向]</pre><h3 id=\"子类型判定的伪代码\">子类型判定的伪代码</h3><p>型变规则写成代码，就是对复合类型递归检查分量方向。参数位置的那次递归把方向「翻转」，这正是逆变的形式化。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"subtype(S, T):                          # 判定 S &lt;: T&#10;  if S == T:                  return true          # 自反&#10;  if S is Cat and T is Animal: return true          # 名义：查声明链&#10;  if T is Record and fields(T) ⊆ fields(S): return true  # 结构：查形状&#10;  if S is Fn(S1→S2) and T is Fn(T1→T2):            # 函数看型变&#10;    return subtype(T1, S1)          # 参数：翻转方向（逆变）&#10;       and subtype(S2, T2)          # 返回：同向（协变）&#10;  if S is Readonly(T_S) and T is Readonly(T_T):     # 只读容器协变&#10;    return subtype(T_S, T_T)&#10;  if S is Mutable(T_S) and T is Mutable(T_T):       # 可变容器不变&#10;    return T_S == T_T&#10;  return false\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>subtype(S, T):                          # 判定 S &#x3C;: T</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if S == T:                  return true          # 自反</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if S is Cat and T is Animal: return true          # 名义：查声明链</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if T is Record and fields(T) ⊆ fields(S): return true  # 结构：查形状</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if S is Fn(S1→S2) and T is Fn(T1→T2):            # 函数看型变</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return subtype(T1, S1)          # 参数：翻转方向（逆变）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>       and subtype(S2, T2)          # 返回：同向（协变）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if S is Readonly(T_S) and T is Readonly(T_T):     # 只读容器协变</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return subtype(T_S, T_T)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if S is Mutable(T_S) and T is Mutable(T_T):       # 可变容器不变</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return T_S == T_T</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return false</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意参数那一行的实参顺序是 <code>subtype(T1, S1)</code> 而非 <code>subtype(S1, T1)</code>——方向被有意调换，才有了「能接受更宽参数者可替代能接受更窄参数者」的结论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"名义子类型-vs-结构子类型\">名义子类型 vs 结构子类型</h2><p>「<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mo>:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S &lt;: T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 何时成立」有两种判定哲学。<strong>名义子类型</strong>（nominal）只看显式声明的继承关系：Java 里 <code>class Dog extends Animal</code> 才让 <code>Dog &lt;: Animal</code>，名字没挂钩就不算子类型。<strong>结构子类型</strong>（structural）只看形状：只要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 拥有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 要求的全部成员且类型兼容，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mo>:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S &lt;: T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 自动成立，无须任何声明。TypeScript 是结构子类型的代表——一个匿名对象只要字段齐全就能赋给某个接口类型；Go 的接口也是结构式的（隐式实现）。</p>\n<p>两种哲学各有取舍。名义子类型让意图明确、避免「碰巧形状相同」的误配，但要求大量样板与前瞻设计；结构子类型灵活、利于鸭子类型与渐进式标注，却可能让两个语义无关、恰好同形的类型意外互通。这条分野直接影响 <a href=\"../foundations/name-resolution\">名称解析与绑定</a> 里重载解析的复杂度，也塑造了 <a href=\"../advanced-typing/flow-sensitive-typing\">流敏感类型与细化</a> 中类型如何被收窄。</p>\n<h2 id=\"隐式转换的代价与可控化\">隐式转换的代价与可控化</h2><p>隐式转换好用，但它是 bug 与混乱的重灾区。C 的「整型提升」和「常用算术转换」让 <code>unsigned</code> 与 <code>signed</code> 比较时悄悄改变语义，催生了无数边界 bug；C++ 的隐式构造函数能让 <code>void f(std::string)</code> 接受一个 <code>char</code>，结果调用方根本没意识到发生了转换。现代语言的对策是收紧：C++ 用 <code>explicit</code> 关键字禁止单参构造函数参与隐式转换；Rust 几乎完全禁止隐式数值转换，要求显式 <code>as</code>；Swift 同样不做隐式数值提升。这种「默认拒绝、显式开口」的趋势与 <a href=\"type-rules-judgments\">类型规则与判断</a> 里「可靠性优先、宁可保守」的精神一脉相承——隐式转换越少，类型检查给出的保证就越强。</p>\n<h3 id=\"一个经典陷阱-signed-unsigned-比较\">一个经典陷阱：signed / unsigned 比较</h3><p>C 的常用算术转换把 <code>int</code> 提升为 <code>unsigned</code>，于是 <code>-1 &lt; 0u</code> 判为假。类型系统没有报错，因为两条转换规则各自都「合法」——问题出在规则的组合上。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"int  a = -1;&#10;unsigned b = 0;&#10;if (a &lt; b)      /* 常见算术转换把 a 提升为 unsigned */&#10;    printf(&quot;yes\\n&quot;);&#10;else&#10;    printf(&quot;no\\n&quot;);   /* 实际输出 no：-1 被当成 0xFFFFFFFF */&#10;&#10;/* 显式开口的对照：Rust 拒绝隐式数值转换 */&#10;let a: i32 = -1;&#10;let b: u32 = 0;&#10;// if a &lt; b { }   // 编译错误：不能比较 i32 与 u32&#10;let eq = (a as i64) &lt; (b as i64);   // 必须显式 as，意图可见\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">unsigned</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b)</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      /* 常见算术转换把 a 提升为 unsigned */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    printf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"yes</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    printf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"no</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   /* 实际输出 no：-1 被当成 0xFFFFFFFF */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 显式开口的对照：Rust 拒绝隐式数值转换 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">let a: i32 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">let b: u32 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// if a &#x3C; b { }   // 编译错误：不能比较 i32 与 u32</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">let eq </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (a as i64) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (b as i64);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   // 必须显式 as，意图可见</span></span></code></pre></div><p>同一段语义，C 沉默地给出反直觉结果，Rust 则在编译期拦住并要求程序员显式表态——两者的差别不在数值规则本身，而在对隐式转换的默认立场。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>子类型 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mo>:</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S &lt;: T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 表示「可替换」，遵循里氏替换并通过包含规则参与类型检查；隐式转换则生成一个表示不同的新值，二者本质不同。</li>\n<li>型变规则决定子类型如何传导：函数对返回类型协变、对参数类型逆变，可变容器必须不变；Java 数组协变是著名的不安全设计。</li>\n<li>名义子类型只认显式声明的继承（Java），结构子类型只看形状是否兼容（TypeScript、Go），前者意图明确、后者灵活。</li>\n<li>隐式转换是 bug 重灾区，现代语言用 <code>explicit</code>、强制 <code>as</code>、禁止隐式数值提升等手段收紧它。</li>\n<li>收紧隐式转换与「可靠性优先」一脉相承：转换越少，静态保证越强。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"子类型与隐式转换","id":"子类型与隐式转换"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"协变、逆变与不变","id":"协变-逆变与不变"},{"level":3,"text":"子类型判定的伪代码","id":"子类型判定的伪代码"},{"level":2,"text":"名义子类型 vs 结构子类型","id":"名义子类型-vs-结构子类型"},{"level":2,"text":"隐式转换的代价与可控化","id":"隐式转换的代价与可控化"},{"level":3,"text":"一个经典陷阱：signed / unsigned 比较","id":"一个经典陷阱-signed-unsigned-比较"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"类型推断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/type-checking-semantic-analysis/type-checking/type-inference"},"next":{"title":"泛型与多态检查","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/type-checking-semantic-analysis/advanced-typing/generics-polymorphism"}}